From 3750352b117a05df456ded4b6f390ab2773cc551 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HELPMEEADICE <58381646+HELPMEEADICE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 17:07:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] remoteproc: qcom: q6v5-mss: power all SDM660 memory banks

SDM660's QDSP6v62 1.5 has 30 memory banks, indexed 29 through 0. Powering only banks 28 through 0 leaves the final bank disabled during the MSS reset sequence.\n\nMatch the downstream qdsp6v62_1_5 reset path by including bank 29 for MSS_SDM660 while retaining the existing count for MSM8998.\n\nFixes: 10b6fec2c8c9 ("remoteproc: qcom: q6v5-mss: Add support for SDM630/636/660")\nSigned-off-by: HELPMEEADICE <58381646+HELPMEEADICE@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c b/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c
index 91940977ca8989..7b1acbf630fd67 100644
--- a/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c
+++ b/drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_mss.c
@@ -815,9 +815,9 @@ static int q6v5proc_reset(struct q6v5 *qproc)
 				mem_pwr_ctl = QDSP6SS_MEM_PWR_CTL;
 				i = 19;
 			} else {
-				/* MSS_MSM8998, MSS_SDM660 */
+				/* SDM660 QDSP6v62 1.5 has one additional memory bank. */
 				mem_pwr_ctl = QDSP6V6SS_MEM_PWR_CTL;
-				i = 28;
+				i = qproc->version == MSS_SDM660 ? 29 : 28;
 			}
 			val = readl(qproc->reg_base + mem_pwr_ctl);
 			for (; i >= 0; i--) {
